window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Kamari Prava Ahvi. Eighteen. Dreamer. Aspiring Bookstagrammer with a knack for photography. Omega… and a runaway bride.</b></p> <p>I was meant to marry a pack chosen by my wealthy father—a carefully curated collection of Alphas who checked all his boxes, but none of mine. So, I ran. Far from the gilded cage of expectations to an Omega haven where I could live anonymously with my best friend, free to dream of viral TikToks, cozy book nooks, and a life entirely my own.</p> <p>But freedom comes at a price, and fate has a cruel sense of humor.</p> <p>My carefully hidden existence crashes into chaos when I encounter <i>them</i>.</p> <p>Damon Castellano, a ruthless mafia kingpin worth billions, whose name alone sends shivers down spines. He's dark, dangerous, and the epitome of power.</p> <p>Rhett \"Blaze\" Holloway, the international racing sensation who's as wild and unpredictable as the bikes he rides. His reputation as a thrill-seeker is matched only by his smoldering gaze.</p> <p>Ezekiel Cross, the hard-nosed detective who's always on the hunt for justice—and now, me. With his steely resolve and handcuffs that don't just stay in the precinct, he's a man of rules. Until I start breaking them.</p> <p>Kieran Blackthorn, the reclusive bestselling dark romance author who's just as mysterious and brooding as the villains he writes. He sees through my walls, and his words cut deeper than any blade.</p> <p>Each of them is dangerous in their own right, but together? They're lethal.</p> <p>They want to claim me, body and soul, but I refuse to be anyone's possession. Yet, when their world collides with mine, the past I ran from resurfaces with a vengeance, and I'm forced into an arrangement I never wanted.</p> <p>Surrounded by possessive, growly Alphas who are determined to keep me safe, I must navigate a world of high-stakes crime, heated desire, and secrets that could destroy us all.</p> <p>Four Alphas. One Omega. And a deal that could either shatter me—or set me free. Because in their arms, I might just find the one thing I never expected: a pack worth fighting for.</p> <p>Knot Their Arrangement <i>is a standalone age-gap Omegaverse with no cliffhanger! This is a steamy dark contemporary romance with no shifter tendencies. It includes MM and MMFMM, and a happily ever after is guaranteed. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
